SUMMARY:Let's Film AVL Brainstorming Session
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Filmmakers and Actors Group\nCome brainstorm with us
 !\n\nWe'll toss ideas around\, play some story improvisation games\, and w
 ork together to (hopefully) come up with an exciting\, feasible idea for a
  short film to be shot in the Asheville area.\n\nAll creatives or interest
 ed parties welcome - no résumé or experience required!\n\nHappens on the
  last Tuesday of every month.
